+# State Space Model (SSM) Support for Aegis
+
+This folder contains starter templates, HIL scenario generators, monitoring exporters, provenance helpers,
+on-device runtime demos and CI workflow examples to make SSMs first-class models in Aegis.
+
+Included:
+- Classical Kalman Filter template + training/eval (ops/ssm/templates/kalman_filter_template)
+- PyTorch RNN-SSM starter + training/export (ops/ssm/templates/pytorch_ssm)
+- HIL system ID scenario manifest + generator (ops/hil/ssm_scenarios)
+- Residuals / NIS Prometheus exporter (ops/monitoring/ssm)
+- Grafana dashboard for SSM diagnostics (ops/monitoring/grafana/ssm_dashboard.json)
+- Provenance enhancement and updater for SSM metadata (ops/provenance)
+- On-device Kalman C demo + Makefile (ops/ssm/on_device)
+- Triton serving notes and example (ops/ssm/serving)
+- SMT starters for Lyapunov/stability invariants and SME meta (ops/formal/ssm_invariants)
+- CI workflow to run SSM unit tests, smoke HIL generation and training ( .github/workflows/ssm_ci.yml )
+
+Quick start:
+1. Use the Kalman template to experiment locally:
+   python ops/ssm/templates/kalman_filter_template/train_and_eval.py
+2. Generate a system ID dataset:
